{"2268240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Razorform", "steam_appid": 2268240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Razorform is a story driven action game that blends intense top-down shooter action with dynamic cinematic angles for a gameplay experience like no other. Players can seamlessly switch between military-themed gunplay and sci-fantasy hack-and-slash blade combat.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Campaign</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate a secret research facility weaponizing the Razorform's power. Unravel the truth of its origins, as you venture through a void of despair and death, in search of ultimate redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/bd89d6c10158e8b56f70ff4b78e7ea93.poster.avif?t=1785862849\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/bd89d6c10158e8b56f70ff4b78e7ea93.webm?t=1785862849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/bd89d6c10158e8b56f70ff4b78e7ea93.mp4?t=1785862849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uniquely Addictive Combat Loop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Razorform merges multiple genres in ways that make it truly unique. No other game matches its fusion of camera angles, weaponry, and combat tactics. Shoot, cloak, grenade, roll, transform, parry, slash, teleport, and devise advanced strategies to efficiently defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/b8d2dee1229b1d66f6fdd75a18dbde98.poster.avif?t=1785862849\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/b8d2dee1229b1d66f6fdd75a18dbde98.webm?t=1785862849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/b8d2dee1229b1d66f6fdd75a18dbde98.mp4?t=1785862849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Story and Lore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your gameplay and intellectual skills to the limit as you dive deeper into the Razorform's lore and origins. Join the community discussion to discover and analyze cryptic information on the classified military experiments that unleashed this chaos on the world, and the individuals who paid the ultimate price to harness its power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/2db31250730469c5f226a0e09ada3b82.poster.avif?t=1785862849\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/2db31250730469c5f226a0e09ada3b82.webm?t=1785862849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/2db31250730469c5f226a0e09ada3b82.mp4?t=1785862849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Razorform is a story driven action game that blends intense top-down shooter action with dynamic cinematic angles for a gameplay experience like no other. Players can seamlessly switch between military-themed gunplay and sci-fantasy hack-and-slash blade combat.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Campaign</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate a secret research facility weaponizing the Razorform's power. Unravel the truth of its origins, as you venture through a void of despair and death, in search of ultimate redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/bd89d6c10158e8b56f70ff4b78e7ea93.poster.avif?t=1785862849\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/bd89d6c10158e8b56f70ff4b78e7ea93.webm?t=1785862849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/bd89d6c10158e8b56f70ff4b78e7ea93.mp4?t=1785862849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uniquely Addictive Combat Loop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Razorform merges multiple genres in ways that make it truly unique. No other game matches its fusion of camera angles, weaponry, and combat tactics. Shoot, cloak, grenade, roll, transform, parry, slash, teleport, and devise advanced strategies to efficiently defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/b8d2dee1229b1d66f6fdd75a18dbde98.poster.avif?t=1785862849\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/b8d2dee1229b1d66f6fdd75a18dbde98.webm?t=1785862849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/b8d2dee1229b1d66f6fdd75a18dbde98.mp4?t=1785862849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Story and Lore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your gameplay and intellectual skills to the limit as you dive deeper into the Razorform's lore and origins. Join the community discussion to discover and analyze cryptic information on the classified military experiments that unleashed this chaos on the world, and the individuals who paid the ultimate price to harness its power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/2db31250730469c5f226a0e09ada3b82.poster.avif?t=1785862849\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/2db31250730469c5f226a0e09ada3b82.webm?t=1785862849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268240/extras/2db31250730469c5f226a0e09ada3b82.mp4?t=1785862849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Infiltrate a classified research facility and unleash the Razorform, a time-warping entity from a dimension of nightmares and chaos. Spray gunfire, uncover military secrets, and slice through enemies with electrified blades. The Razorform is a single player atmospheric sci-fi action game.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languag